∇ fakes←FakeWords words;w;k;f
 ⍝ For each word, the next PoolPlus entry reshaped to its length, skipping any
 ⍝ already used or equal to a real word. The choice depends only on the order
 ⍝ the words appear in, not on the words, so it can't be reversed by trying a
 ⍝ list of staff names.
  fakes←⍬ ⋄ k←0
  :For w :In words
      :Repeat
          k+←1
          :If k>≢PoolPlus ⋄ 'Ran out of fake words'⎕SIGNAL 11 ⋄ :EndIf
          f←(≢w)⍴k⊃PoolPlus
      :Until ~(⊂⎕C f)∊⎕C¨fakes,words
      fakes,←⊂f
  :EndFor
∇
